@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewBag.Title = "Our story";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>@ViewBag.Title - @MvcApplication.project_name</title>
</head>
@Html.Partial("css")
<body class="body-our-story-page">
    @Html.Partial("header")
    <div class="main our-story-page">

        <section class="our-story banner">
            <div class="our-story-banner-main"
                 style="background: url('/Assets/images/our-story-banner.png') no-repeat center center / cover;">
                <div class="container banner-container">
                    <div class="content-wrapper wow fadeInUp">
                        <h1 class="font-caveat font-size-caveat-main">JuggleJoy's founding tale: how we transformed chaos into calm </h1>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="our-story-intro">
            <div class="our-story-intro-main background-logo">
                <div class="container-col-8">

                    <p class="medium-p">
                        JuggleJoy emerged from the depths of two parents’ most profound emotions, at a time when life felt like a relentless pursuit of balance. We were trying to balance careers and our own needs with a genuine desire to positively shape our children's lives. Like many parents, we felt the weight of an ever-growing list of household tasks and responsibilities, preventing us from enjoying precious moments. It hummed in the background as a constant presence each day. An unending cycle of chores. We thought to ourselves:
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="font-caveat text-center wow fadeInUp">“How could we reach a point where everyday chores didn't overshadow the joys of  family life?”</h4>

                    <p class="medium-p">
                        Evenings once meant for calm and connection turned into battlefields of calming overhyped kids after juggling long days of work, school and chores. The emotional residue lingered, making it challenging to create the serene moments that bring us together. The mental load of anticipating everything that needed to get done for the days, weeks and months ahead took a massive toll.
                    </p>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="our-story-intro-next">
            <div class="our-story-intro-next-main">
                <div class="container-col-8">

                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-12 content-column">
                            <h2 class="font-caveat font-size-caveat-main">Finding the answer</h2>
                            <p class="medium-p">
                                The search for a solution became more than a quest for convenience; it became a quest for emotional relief. Full-time nannies and personal assistants felt like distant dreams—elusive and expensive.
                                <br><br>
                                How could we create more family time together, in which we didn’t feel the pressure of an overwhelming to-do list?
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-12 image-column">
                            <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story-section-2.png" alt="our-story-section" class="wow fadeInRight">
                        </div>

                    </div>
                    <br>
                    <p class="medium-p">
                        During this desperate search for an alternative, JuggleJoy was born — a platform with a beating heart, designed to ease the burdens that stretch every modern-day family, granting them the most precious gift: time. Time for what genuinely matters most in life.
                    </p>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="our-promise section-position">
            <div class="our-promise-main our-promise-main-top">
                <div class="container-col-8">
                    <h2 class="font-caveat font-size-caveat-main">Our promise</h2>
                    <p>
                        We are more than a platform. We are a promise to overwhelmed families. Imagine shedding the emotional weight of perpetual planning, experiencing the calm after the storm, and finding joy because you averted the chaos!
                        <br><br>
                        JuggleJoy is your approachable companion: always ready to help as and when a task crops up. Our assistants are committed to turning daunting tasks into manageable moments of joy. With warmth and understanding, we assure you — we've got this.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="our-promise-main our-promise-main-bottom">
                <div class="container-col-8">
                    <div class="image-container">
                        <div class="image-wrapper">
                            <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story-promise.png" alt="our-story-promise" class="wow fadeIn" data-wow-duration="1s">
                            <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story-promise-1.png" alt="our-story-promise-1" class="wow fadeInRight">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="our-mission section-position">
            <div class="our-mission-main background-logo">
                <div class="container-col-8">
                    <h2 class="font-caveat font-size-caveat-main">Our mission</h2>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-12">
                            <div class="content">
                                <div class="content-wrapper">
                                    <div class="content-icon wow fadeInLeft">
                                        <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story/our-mission-simplify.png"
                                             alt="our-mission-simplify">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 class="wow fadeInRight">Simplify</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    <strong>JuggleJoy</strong> aims to simplify the lives of busy families by efficiently managing routine tasks, allowing them to reclaim valuable time for what truly matters.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-12">

                            <div class="content">
                                <div class="content-wrapper">
                                    <div class="content-icon wow fadeInLeft">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/our-story/our-mission-enhance.png"
                                             alt="our-mission-enhance">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 class="wow fadeInRight">Enhance</h4>

                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    <strong>We</strong>strive to enhance the overall well-being of families by providing personalised support, flexibility and stress-free solutions, ensuring a more organised and enjoyable 
family life.
</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-12">

                            <div class="content">
                                <div class="content-wrapper">
                                    <div class="content-icon wow fadeInLeft">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/our-story/our-mission-enjoy.png"
                                             alt="our-mission-enjoy">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 class="wow fadeInRight">Enjoy</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    <strong>Our</strong>r mission is for families to actively enjoy quality time together, unburdened by mundane tasks. Let us help you create a balance between work, personal growth and cherished family moments.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>


                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="container section-position">

                    <div class="our-mission-image-container">
                        <div class="our-mission-image-wrapper wow fadeInUp">
                            <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story/our-mission-1.png" alt="our-mission-1">
                            <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story/our-mission-2.png" alt="our-mission-2">
                            <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story/our-mission-3.png" alt="our-mission-3">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

        <section class="our-values">
            <div class="our-values-main">
                <div class="container-col-8">
                    <h2 class="font-caveat font-size-caveat-main">Our values</h2>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-12">
                            <div class="content">
                                <div class="content-wrapper">
                                    <div class="content-icon wow fadeInLeft">
                                        <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story/forward-thinking.png"
                                             alt="our-mission-forward-thinking">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 class="wow fadeInRight">Forward-thinking</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    We’re passionate about exploring cutting-edge technologies and strategies to streamline tasks, enhancing our customer experiences and, revolutionising family management in an ever-changing world.
                                    Forward-thinking drives us to stay ahead of the curve, anticipating challenges and offering helpful solutions to simplify and enrich the lives of working parents.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-12">
                            <div class="content">
                                <div class="content-wrapper">
                                    <div class="content-icon wow fadeInLeft">
                                        <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story/personable.png"
                                             alt="our-mission-personable">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 class="wow fadeInRight">Personable</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    Empathy and warmth is at the heart of every interaction, because we’ve been there. We understand the needs and challenges of our customers. Through our personalised and caring approach, we aim to become a trusted companion in the lives of busy families, offering not just services, but a comforting and understanding presence in their journey towards a balanced life.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-12">
                            <div class="content">
                                <div class="content-wrapper">
                                    <div class="content-icon wow fadeInLeft">
                                        <img src="~/Assets/images/our-story/aspirational.png"
                                             alt="our-mission-aspirational">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 class="wow fadeInRight">Aspirational</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    We aim to ignite a sense of possibility and ambition in every working parent. It isn’t a dream to have a career and a family - it's totally possible to achieve family well-being without sacrificing career aspirations.
                                    Our services are shaking up family norms - motivating and empowering everyone to aspire towards a life where family happiness takes precedence over constant work demands.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
    @Html.Partial("footer")
    @Html.Partial("js")
</body>
</html>